      "description": "確認要覆蓋這一局進度。",
      "html": "<dialog class=\"ds-restart\" open aria-labelledby=\"ds-restart-title\"><h2 id=\"ds-restart-title\">重新開會？</h2><p>這一局會被覆蓋，下次開場會重新抽出會議議題。</p><form method=\"dialog\"><button class=\"ds-action ds-cancel\">繼續這局</button><button class=\"ds-action ds-confirm\">重新開會</button></form></dialog>",
      "css": ".ds-restart{position:relative;margin:0 auto;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:min(100%,430px);background:var(--plum,#26162e);color:var(--pale,#fff1e2);border:1px solid var(--edge,#583d5c);padding:25px;border-radius:8px;}\n.ds-restart h2{margin:0;line-height:1.15;}\n.ds-restart p{margin:.85rem 0 1.25rem;color:var(--dim,#ccb7c8);}\n.ds-restart form{display:flex;justify-content:end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;}\n.ds-restart button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.65rem;min-height:45px;padding:.68rem 1rem;text-align:center;font:inherit;font-weight:800;line-height:1.4;border:1px solid;border-radius:4px;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;}\n.ds-restart button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#ffc374);outline-offset:4px;}\n.ds-cancel{background:#34223f;border-color:#745677;color:var(--pale,#fff1e2);}\n.ds-cancel:hover{background:#4c3152;}\n.ds-confirm{color:var(--dark-coral,#2f1019);background:var(--coral,#ff836e);border-color:var(--coral,#ff836e);}\n.ds-confirm:hover{background:#ffa892;border-color:#ffa892;}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-action{transition-duration:.01ms;}}"
